<title>INDIA: India HLL, Brooke Bond to finalise merger on Friday.</title>
<headline>India HLL, Brooke Bond to finalise merger on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The boards of Hindustan Lever Ltd and Brooke Bond Lipton India -- two Indian subsidiaries of Unilever Plc -- will meet on Friday to finalise merger of the two firms, a spokesman of Hindustan Lever told Reuters on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>He said the combined results of the merged entity for calendar 1996 would be finalised at Friday's meeting.</p>
<p>Hindustan Lever is India's leading producer of soaps and detergents. Brooke Bond Lipton is a leading producer of tea and processed foods.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
